;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 TMTA High School Calculus Contest Problems/Problem 40 (page does not exist)\">40</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_Past_Problems/Solutions\" title=\"TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions\">All TMTA Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018035129\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.054 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 221/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3851/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 560/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4549/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    8.380      1 Template:TMTA_box\n100.00%    8.380      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36344:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018035129 and revision id 281455. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}